        "description": "{#ff0000|Lurker}\n\nLurkers are rare types of beholders, which were created by the twisted warlock Agar. Their familiar look might be deceiving, because they have been credited with different magic ingredients in order to gain different abilities from other types of evil eyes. \n\n{gold|Special Ability: Ranged magic missile attack. Flight. Casts negative spell after every attack.}\n\nUnlike regular beholders, these aberrations can fly thanks to their antigravitational magic aura.\nWhen lurkers attack, they shoot a dark magic energy bolt, which randomly casts a harmful spell on an enemy. The possible spells include: {#00aaff|Curse, Disrupting Ray, Slow, Sorrow, Weakness, Forgetfulness, Misfortune}, {#40bfff|Magic Leech, Cowardice, and Cancellation}.",
